<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Marisa Christina cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Marisa Christina cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it downgraded Marisa Christina Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- said recent conversations with company management give Rodman &amp; Renshaw analysts the &quot;sense&quot; that company's bookings for the second half of the year &quot;may be lagging somewhat.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said was changing rating until the company's earnings per share outlook &quot;is more certain.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock fell 7/8 to 8-1/2.</p>
</text>
